    <dashboard _.fcp.AccessibleZoneTabOrder.true...enable-sort-zone-taborder='true' name='Dashboard 8'>
      <style />
      <size maxheight='800' maxwidth='1000' minheight='800' minwidth='1000' />
      <zones>
        <zone h='100000' id='4' type-v2='layout-basic' w='100000' x='0' y='0'>
          <zone forceUpdate='true' h='98000' id='3' type-v2='text' w='98400' x='800' y='1000'>
            <formatted-text>
              <run>The first draft of OKR Metrics Dashboard, the metrics are still launching and ongoing phase on global level, that&apos;s why for some metrics are full visibility for all entities and regions but mostly on product level feature based metrics are not globally launched yet. Please find the overview about the metrics: 

Zombies-Low Orders and First 30 Days Related Metrics: Global visibility
VFD Related Metrics: Global visibility apart from non VFD entities Woova,Instashop,Zomato,Carriage 
Menu Management; Only Foodpanda Asia, Foodpanda European countries(Finland,Sweden,Czech Republic,Austria,Hungary,Slovakia) and Talabat available
VFD Self Service:Only in Pedidos available 
NPS New and Existing Vendors Survey: FP Asia, Talabat,Pedidos,DH Greece,Hunger Station, DH Europe available
Average Onboarding Time: Salesforce Data only in SF countries available. 
VFD Plugin CSAT Menu Management: Related to Plugin only in MM launched countries available. 
Opening Times Plugin CSAT: 
Contact Rate: SF Data only in SF </run>
            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
